# Polylang E2E

Helpers: `@wpsyntex/e2e-test-utils`, then `tests/e2e/plugins/` (`custom-strings/`, `translation-updates/`). Image snapshots only — this repo has no download fixtures.

```js
const screenshot = await locator.screenshot();
expect( screenshot ).toMatchSnapshot( 'name.png', { maxDiffPixelRatio: 0.25 } );
```

Do not redact language names or switcher markup. Layout: `.cursor/reference/e2e-conventions.md`.
